[[Category:Creatures]]

Forest snails can be made into [[Escargots d'Amour]] and [[Onioned Escargot]], which provides an efficient source of FEPs and Energy early-on.

They do not have any byproducts, cannot be wrung by their neck, and can be picked up by right-clicking them.

== How to Acquire ==

Snail may be found in the any [[Forest]].

